  "releaseNotes": "TCMProject.Utilities: adds APPROVE_ABSENCE_REQUESTS (=30, \"Aprobar solicitudes de ausencia\") to PermissionEnum in TCMEnums. Grants approving or rejecting time-off requests from any worker in the company, which is what lets a shared approval inbox work: the request is not addressed to a person, so whoever holds the permission can resolve it if the usual approver is away (scheduleeasycore SCH-46). Appended at the end with the next correlative value, per the bit-position rule of the enum. Non-breaking, additive.",
